### ============================================================
### ARCCLAW API TEST SUITE
### Phase 32: REST API Authentication
### Phase 33: Prompt Injection Filter
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@validKey = key-JV/qXAikcUoSCCUsqYxLvNjxW/N3KROQtawg3VRFrJs=
@invalidKey = totally-wrong-key

### ============================================================
### PHASE 32 — AUTH: NEGATIVE TESTS (should fail)
### ============================================================

### 1. Missing API Key → expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Invalid API Key → expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{invalidKey}}

###

### 3. Health check bypasses auth → expect 200 (no key needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/health

###

### 4. Metrics bypasses auth → expect 200 (no key needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/q/metrics

###

### ============================================================
### PHASE 32 — AUTH: POSITIVE FLOW (valid key)
### ============================================================

### 5. Create Session with valid key
# @name createSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### 6. Run Agent Async (uses sessionId from step 5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{createSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run-async
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Analyze the rsrini7/arcclaw repository on github and tell me what it does",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 5
}

### Approve pending tool execution (after AWAITING_APPROVAL response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{createSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "/approve",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}

###

### Deny pending tool execution
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{createSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "/deny",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}


###

### 7. Check Status (uses sessionId from step 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{createSession.response.body.sessionId}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

@sessionIdHardcoded = 6a26b16d-45ef-3338-b0d7-8d2782fc2d14

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{sessionIdHardcoded}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}


###

### 8. Run Agent Synchronously
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{createSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Analyze the arcclaw repository statistics using gh tool",
    "agentRole": "coordinator"
}

###

### 9. Terminate Session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{createSession.response.body.sessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

