### ============================================================
### PHASE 35 — IMMUTABLE AUDIT LOG (WORM)
### Prerequisites:
###   1. Send a message via Telegram to generate a session
###   2. Derive sessionId:
###      UUID.nameUUIDFromBytes((chatId + userId).getBytes(UTF_8))
###   3. Set @auditSessionId below to that value
### ============================================================

@auditSessionId = 6a26b16d-45ef-3338-b0d7-8d2782fc2d14

### ============================================================
### AUDIT: READ
### ============================================================

### A1. List all audit events for a session (ordered by sequence ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/session/{{auditSessionId}}
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### A2. Verify HMAC chain integrity for a session
### expect: { "valid": true, "brokenAtId": null, "totalRows": N }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audit/session/{{auditSessionId}}/verify
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

